        <mxCell id="VZsmsm63-oTfytbhLIAe-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Core Backend Loop&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Backend will assign cameras to Camera_AI_assignments&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Backend has ability to toggle a camera overall as well as disable certain rules.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Going a scope higher there is another toggle button for a site where a worker is turnt off for the entire site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Backend will read from the AI&#39;s Schema camera_claims and workers table to return the true status to frontend.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="218" width="275" x="33" y="746" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
